{
  "slug": "altertable",
  "name": "Altertable",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Altertable gives Claude governed access to your Altertable workspace so it can explore data, query the lakehouse, analyze product and business metrics, and help turn raw data into insights. The plugin bundles Altertable-specific Agent Skills with the Altertable MCP, allowing Claude to inspect schemas, write and run SQL, analyze funnels, build segments, interpret charts, forecast time series, configure monitoring agents, manage discoveries, and use memory for richer follow-up analysis. It is designed for teams using Altertable as an AI-native data platform where humans and agents work from the same governed data context.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **19 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (19): `analyze-funnels` (Creates and analyzes conversion funnels), `analyze-insights` (Interprets Insight data to identify patterns, anomalies, and trends), `analyze-web-traffic` (Analyzes web analytics traffic patterns and user behavior), `ask` (Routes user queries to the best-fit Altertable skill), `build-segments` (Builds segmentation insights with filters, dimensions, and breakdowns), `configure-tasks` (Configures scheduled AI tasks that analyze Insights and Dashboards), `create-discoveries` (Creates Altertable discoveries from meaningful findings), `create-insights` (Creates, drafts, renders, and saves Altertable insights), and 11 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `altertable-mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install altertable@claude-community` from `altertable-ai/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 19,
    "mcp": 1
  },
